{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0de94997-2f9e-828d-8b90-902829e5ed87",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T14:28:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I think I'm calling about the February vacation week camp? Maybe you run one, I'm sort of not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do, yeah! We have a vacation week program for school-aged kids. Are you looking to sign someone up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I think so. I have a nephew I'm watching that week, so maybe. I just need to know the details, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:23:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What would you like to know first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:23:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I think the first thing is the start date. When does it start, sort of exactly? I thought maybe it was this coming Monday but I'm not positive."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:24:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull it up here. Okay, so February vacation week for Newport schools is next week, and the camp runs along with that, Monday through Friday. So Monday is your first day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:24:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Monday. So that's, I think, the twenty-third?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one, Monday the twenty-third."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And I think it's all day? Or maybe it's half days. I sort of saw something but it was small print."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:24:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a full-day program. Drop-off is in the morning and pickup is late afternoon. I can give you the exact times if you want to write them down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, let me find a pen. [pause] Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Drop-off is eight-thirty to nine, and pickup is between four and four-thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight-thirty to nine, four to four-thirty. Got it, I think. Is there still room, maybe? Or is it sort of full already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:25:15-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm showing there are still spots open, but they do go fast the closer we get. If you want to register, you can do it through the office or on the city website, and you'd need your nephew's name, birthday, and an emergency contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think I have most of that. His birthday I'd have to check with his mother, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, you can call back or fill it out online once you have it. And if he's not a Newport resident, that's fine too, there might just be a slightly different rate. The office can go over that with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:26:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He's, I think, from Middletown. So maybe that's the different rate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:26:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be, yes. We'd sort that out when you register."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:26:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Um, while I have you, can I ask something that's sort of unrelated? It's about a parking sticker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, go ahead. I might have to transfer you depending on what it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I have a resident parking sticker, I think from last year or maybe the year before, and it keeps peeling off the glass. I stick it back on and a week later it's on the floor of the car again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, those are annoying. That one's not actually ours, parking stickers go through a different office. I can transfer you over, or give you the main City Hall line if you'd rather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:27:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Transfer is fine, I think. Is it going to ring a long time? I'm on my cell and it's sort of spotty here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:27:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll stay on until someone picks up. Before I do, do you want me to note anything for the camp? I can't hold a spot, but I can leave a note that you called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:27:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe just that. My name is Sean McCarthy. And I think my number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:27:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sean McCarthy, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. Got it. And that's for the vacation week camp, starting Monday the twenty-third."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:27:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome! Okay, let me send you over to the parking folks. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. [line breaks up] Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still here, Sean. It's ringing. [pause] Looks like they're on another call, so I'll leave you in their queue. Take care!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
